            <ArticleTitle>Pseudo-ainhum Associated with Spina-bifida Occulta and Hemivertebra.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>95-96</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 7 year old girl had pseudo-ainhum, spina-bifida occulta, A hemivertebra and focal, neurogical deficit. The disease process was progressive for the last three years leading to amputation of the third digit and formation of constricting bands around -the fourth and the fifth digits of the left foot.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
